{
  "page": 574,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5476,
      "text": "O you the enwrapped one[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5477,
      "text": "Stand up in prayer at night except a little,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5478,
      "text": "half of it, or a little less,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5479,
      "text": "or a little more, and recite the Qur’an at a measured pace.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5480,
      "text": "We will send down upon you a heavy Word[2].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5481,
      "text": "Indeed, worship at night is more effective[3] and more conducive to proper recitation[4].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5482,
      "text": "In the daytime, you have plenty of time for your worldly matters.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5483,
      "text": "And remember the Name of your Lord, and devote yourself completely to Him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5484,
      "text": "[He is] Lord of the east and the west; none has the right to be worshiped except Him, so take Him as the Disposer of your affairs[5].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5485,
      "text": "Bear patiently what they say, and avoid them in a gracious manner.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5486,
      "text": "Leave to Me the deniers who are having a life of luxury, and bear with them for a little while.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5487,
      "text": "Indeed, We have heavy shackles and a Blazing Fire,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5488,
      "text": "and food that chokes, and a painful punishment,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5489,
      "text": "on the Day when the earth and the mountains will convulse, and the mountains will be like dunes of loose sand.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5490,
      "text": "Indeed, We have sent to you a Messenger to be a witness over you, just as We sent to Pharaoh a messenger.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5491,
      "text": "But Pharaoh disobeyed the messenger, so We seized him with a severe punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5492,
      "text": "If you disbelieve, then how will you protect yourselves against a Day that will turn children’s hair gray?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5493,
      "text": "It will cause the sky to break asunder[6]. His promise will certainly be fulfilled.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5494,
      "text": "Indeed, this is a reminder; so whoever wills may take a way to his Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
  "language": "en"
}
